\item[S2] William Banks, Paul Pollack and Carl Pomerance, \emph{Symmetric primes revisited}, arXiv:1908.06161v2 (2019), §1, Theorems 1.1--1.2 and the density conjecture following them. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/1908.06161v2}.
